[{"id":"question_37d5fa74-3b3b-4362-ad9a-c3b88c1126a8","html":"<div style=\"display: grid; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap;\">观察原创钟面，现在是几时？请把两针的观察依据说完整。</div><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"较短指针指向数字4；较长指针指向数字12\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/2e83e3493df83ca724b2b6d5e64c5aa5c6e01fc1b075737d24059f2032ce2467.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"></figure></div><section style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 234, 254); background: rgb(248, 251, 255);\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(71, 85, 105);\"><strong>写出你的想法</strong></div><textarea aria-label=\"文字作答\" placeholder=\"请输入答案\" rows=\"5\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); resize: vertical;\"></textarea></section></div>"},{"id":"question_75a53f5c-730c-44f3-89b5-7baf93caf625","html":"<div style=\"display: grid; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap;\">观察原创钟面，可说快8时了还是8时整？请根据两针位置说明，不强求准确几分。</div><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"较短指针在数字7和8之间，靠近8；较长指针在数字11和12之间，靠近12\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/7eab6b8bd4d33edf8493320748b1e682feef7845a7a05fb9be0fda07f202ac01.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"></figure></div><section style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 234, 254); background: rgb(248, 251, 255);\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(71, 85, 105);\"><strong>写出你的想法</strong></div><textarea aria-label=\"文字作答\" placeholder=\"请输入答案\" rows=\"5\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); resize: vertical;\"></textarea></section></div>"},{"id":"question_0c2b9d4e-19fd-46f3-b374-7c66bd5a1b3e","html":"<div style=\"display: grid; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap;\">观察原创甲乙两面钟，它们能都说成6时整吗？分别核两针并给合适表达。</div><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"甲图；较短指针在数字5和6之间，靠近6；较长指针在数字11和12之间，靠近12\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/186d54596c8f35e36da3d4e3c8c165a6cc39de2b483223e1f31ce080927e9603.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"><figcaption style=\"color: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-size: 14px;\">甲图</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"乙图；较短指针指向数字6；较长指针指向数字12\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/2a753c96513d91644866207eb7f1fe4fb63f6f17ad851c34bdd429d17671e599.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"><figcaption style=\"color: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-size: 14px;\">乙图</figcaption></figure></div><section style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 234, 254); background: rgb(248, 251, 255);\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(71, 85, 105);\"><strong>写出你的想法</strong></div><textarea aria-label=\"文字作答\" placeholder=\"请输入答案\" rows=\"5\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); resize: vertical;\"></textarea></section></div>"},{"id":"question_f5aecebf-0ef2-44f6-bd64-db8ecc8d5b8e","html":"<div style=\"display: grid; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap;\">按整体外形说出原创甲乙丙丁模型的类别，各给出一条观察依据；不能只看当前某个面或颜色。</div><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"立体模型，沿三个方向的长度相同，显示三个正方形平面的投影。；甲模型\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/1343881d917a317d1d7f75570621adb05193585c5c9b2873458cf6607dbad044.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"><figcaption style=\"color: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-size: 14px;\">甲模型</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"光滑圆曲面模型，以明暗显示立体感，没有平面或棱角。；乙模型\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/376a9be39b8147e04691e347db69bc8ae57ee6fe2b0b8142b1f5e380ee1cb560.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"><figcaption style=\"color: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-size: 14px;\">乙模型</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"盒状立体模型，显示三个平面，沿三个方向的长度不全相同。；丙模型\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/915a01dc652e526525978382e56f7c98abdf5d6203297c01ec2c2a35bc549a95.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"><figcaption style=\"color: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-size: 14px;\">丙模型</figcaption></figure><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"直立模型，上下是同样大小的圆面，中间连接弯曲的侧面。；丁模型\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/ff611e26e360921a19afdf33672d376d5d1ca6867460a8265ec954f98e34734a.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"><figcaption style=\"color: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-size: 14px;\">丁模型</figcaption></figure></div><section style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 234, 254); background: rgb(248, 251, 255);\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(71, 85, 105);\"><strong>写出你的想法</strong></div><textarea aria-label=\"文字作答\" placeholder=\"请输入答案\" rows=\"5\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); resize: vertical;\"></textarea></section></div>"},{"id":"question_27876d99-a63a-41c8-871a-fbee96944ca5","html":"<div style=\"display: grid; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap;\">观察原创模型，用自己的话说明两端与中间侧面有什么不同，不把整个立体当成一张平面圆。</div><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"直立模型，上下是同样大小的圆面，中间连接弯曲的侧面。\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/efd3f89763478db257d29730b36fe551ba6029d1f5643227c0825cab2a13d094.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"></figure></div><section style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 234, 254); background: rgb(248, 251, 255);\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(71, 85, 105);\"><strong>写出你的想法</strong></div><textarea aria-label=\"文字作答\" placeholder=\"请输入答案\" rows=\"5\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); resize: vertical;\"></textarea></section></div>"},{"id":"question_323c75db-b3fb-4433-8afe-eec0eb6f2a36","html":"<div style=\"display: grid; gap: 18px;\"><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap;\">观察原创模型的几个可见平面，有人把它们数成三块积木。请解释看到的面与完整一块的区别。</div><figure style=\"margin: 0px; display: grid; gap: 8px;\"><img alt=\"立体模型，沿三个方向的长度相同，显示三个正方形平面的投影。\" src=\"/question-assets/source-math-v1/1899aa41b8a5071a5d94353db5e46eabc75bf186ab4c8e389c6ef945396260ee.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(226, 232, 240);\"></figure></div><section style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid rgb(219, 234, 254); background: rgb(248, 251, 255);\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(71, 85, 105);\"><strong>写出你的想法</strong></div><textarea aria-label=\"文字作答\" placeholder=\"请输入答案\" rows=\"5\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgb(203, 213, 225); background: rgb(255, 255, 255); resize: vertical;\"></textarea></section></div>"}]